WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.130
The beautiful land of Great Japan.

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:09.830
However, this very beauty is often the target of the cunning of the wicked.

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:15.330
But heed my words! Worry not! Fear not!

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.900
For there are samurai who watch over the land!

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.670
<b>Master Samurai</b>

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.730
They are the Master Samurai!

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:34.940
Hyakka Ryouran: the samurai girls' story of love, courage, and kisses.

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:59.620
I see you've come, wicked spirits.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.210
Or should I say... Dark Samurai?

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.220
Sorry to crash the party so soon after your revival, but I'm here to take you out.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:07.730
Huh?

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:11.600
Did foreigners take over the country while we were taking a nap?

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.560
A Master Samurai.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:20.720
So the Tokugawas are still in power?

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:27.660
In the name of my General,

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.870
I shall eradicate you!

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:37.290
Sounds like fun! I think I'll play along.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.420
I've been on a journey.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.310
Half a year has passed since that battle.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:53.910
I've traveled from Oedo to Yonezawa to discipline myself and improve my skills as a General.

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:57.210
I must prepare for the inevitable return of Amakusa Shiro

00:01:57.210 --> 00:02:01.520
and protect Great Japan from those with evil in their hearts.

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:06.050
Good morning, Matabei-san.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:09.670
Muneakira-san! Welcome back.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:12.740
How were your travels?

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:17.410
I've learned a lot, but I've still got quite a ways to go.

00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:21.540
By the way, maid cafes are very popular now across the country.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.090
If a town's got an inn, it's sure to have a maid cafe too.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:25.120
Did you know that?

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:26.710
Well...

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:30.090
I'm not sure if that kind of western influence is such a good thing, though.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:35.710
I'm kinda glad this academy is still free of that.

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:37.480
Don't you agree?

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:40.230
U-Um...

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.190
What's wrong, Matabei-san?

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.150
Look.

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:54.120
What's going on here?

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:58.310
Why has the dojo turned into a maid cafe?!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.160
Because I ordered it to.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.290
Yukimura?!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.170
Good to see you back from your travels.

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:09.030
No, it's not good to be back! What's going on here?!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.470
What's wrong? Don't you know?

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.650
You read this character as "moe."

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:15.590
It's the keyword for making money.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:16.720
Making money?

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:21.980
Indeed. You write it as "Shinkage" and read it as "True Shadow."

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:25.730
And as of today, the True Shadow Maid Cafe is open for business!

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:26.460
Opens Today
And as of today, the True Shadow Maid Cafe is open for business!

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.400
Opens Today

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:31.660
Are you seriously thinking of turning the dojo into a maid cafe?!

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:35.570
Yuki! I've finished changing!

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:39.260
Onii-chan!

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.720
I'm back, Juubei.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:44.420
Onii-chan! Welcome home!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.160
No, that's not how it goes!

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:50.550
Oh, right!

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:55.140
Welcome back, master!

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:57.640
Th-That appearance...

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:02.600
No way!

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:05.700
How could you do this to our sacred dojo?

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:07.230
Are you okay, Onii-chan?

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:10.210
I can't face my ancestors like this.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:12.120
But it's a lot cuter!

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.980
It's all because of the Reiman shock.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.310
Rei... man?

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:20.490
Indeed. The Reiman shock.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:25.900
The financial crisis that broke out after the collapse of the mortgage bubble.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:29.500
Our military funds were pretty much turned to dust!

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:33.000
Even the dojo's kitchen fell victim!

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:37.280
What does that mean, Onii-chan?

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.360
Don't ask me.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:43.140
My point is that we need to make some money to survive!

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:45.850
What about the prize from the government?

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:50.980
We sealed Amakusa, so there should be some kind of reward.

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:52.140
As for that...

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:56.880
Yukimura! These clothes are all the wrong size!

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:59.330
Are you trying to put me to shame?

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.870
Princess Sen...

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:06.740
Let me know sooner that you've come back! Stupid!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.850
I'm sorry.

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:10.850
Milady, your clothes!

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:12.260
Get lost!

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:16.470
Welcome back, Muneakira-san.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:20.100
It's good to be back, Hanzou-san.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:24.850
You really don't know anything about the hero who sealed Amakusa Shiro?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.600
Huh? Wasn't that us?

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:32.020
You haven't changed at all.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.290
So then...

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:35.020
Look.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:38.090
This ought to make things a lot clearer.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:41.660
Lord Yoshihiko saves Great Japan?!

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:48.170
Officially, my brother and the blue-eyed Master Samurai were the ones who saved this country.

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:51.200
Yoshihiko is now a nationally celebrated hero.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.680
I don't really mind that, but we should get some kind of reward!

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:58.230
Sen tried arguing with them, but they kept referring to government policies.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.510
So not even a cent?

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:04.930
See? This is why you can't trust anyone in the Tokugawa.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:08.660
It was your fault for not managing things properly in the first place!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.700
No, it was because you kept wasting money!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.270
Cut it out, you two!

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:17.040
This isn't the time to be fighting among ourselves.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.530
If we don't have any money, then we should work together to make some!

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:21.840
I know.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:24.540
That's why we opened a maid cafe.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:27.130
You could've chosen a more respectable trade.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:28.440
Naive!

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:29.790
You're just too naive!

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.950
Hanzou! Prepare to do <i>that</i>!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:32.710
Roger.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:34.800
Matabei! Time for <i>that</i>!

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:35.590
Roger.

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.380
Listen up, Muneakira.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.090
This is a maid cafe.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:42.960
Get yummy! Get yummy!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.010
Moe-moe-kyun!

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:47.640
Harakiri?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.320
It's done!

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:53.100
What's this? I don't eve-

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.320
It looks so yummy!

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.250
Listen now, Muneakira.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.650
We're going to tell you something astonishing.

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:00.800
This rice omelette would normally sell for 800 yen,

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:04.500
but in a maid cafe we can sell it for 1,500!

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.060
Hurray!

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:09.050
Talk about easy money!

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.250
H-How pitiful...

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.920
You fool!

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:21.510
We can't escape poverty through traditional trade!

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:23.270
Listen.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.350
If we cancel this project,

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:30.020
our losses will skyrocket, and in three months we'll have to hand over the dojo.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.650
Why the dojo?

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.240
What's so surprising?

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:36.480
Collateral is needed for a secured loan.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:41.960
How could you put the dojo up as collateral?!

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:46.280
Onii-chan! Let's make this maid cafe successful!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.250
Right.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.990
Hurray!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:52.890
Don't worry, Muneakira.

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:54.950
Success is guaranteed.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:58.130
Not to mention that all sense of danger has left the house, too.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:02.830
Danger? That reminds me, isn't someone missing?

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.550
You're just imagining things!

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:14.080
My God, this place is creepy.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:18.570
The True Shadow Maid Cafe opens today!

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:24.030
If you bring in this flyer, you can get discounts on the entire menu!

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:30.230
Christ! Naoe Kanetsugu, the champion of love herself, is handing these out!

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:32.500
Someone take these!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.740
This isn't normal at all!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.560
Why do I have to hand out flyers in this abandoned place?

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:44.370
That forehead runt tricked me!

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.820
Hey, you there.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.560
What are you doing here?

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.780
Huh? Where did she come from?

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.060
Maid cafe.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.550
Here too?

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:03.440
Sounds like a great place to visit after reviving.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:08.870
R-Reviving? Really now, you're just messing around with me.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.910
Are you supposed to be ghosts then?

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:14.560
Listen. I want to ask you something.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.040
Yes?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.400
Where's the Yagyuu Dojo?

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:23.510
Coming Soon
Maid Cafe True Shadow

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.890
Does this look like the Yagyuu Dojo to you?

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.360
A maid cafe.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:31.470
She pretended to know where it was and tricked us?

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:34.820
This is ridiculous. Let's head back.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:36.200
Geez.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:40.160
What's this?

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:45.530
Welcome home, miladies!

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.990
Wh-What is this?

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.490
We haven't even ordered anything yet!

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:55.900
It's okay.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.480
It looks delicious,

00:09:58.480 --> 00:09:59.880
and we've got plenty of money.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:02.250
I can use this here, right?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:06.380
Th-That's a Tokugawa authorized black card!

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:09.460
Please forgive our impudence, miladies.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:12.100
We shall prepare the VIP course for you.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:14.780
Matabei-san, Juubei-san,

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:18.300
please provide these goldmin- I mean, our dear guests with first-class service.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.600
Okie-dokie!

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:22.400
Let's cast a spell then!

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:30.180
Moe-moe-kyun-kyun!

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:31.410
Why don't you say it with us?

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:37.760
Get yummy! Get yummy!

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:40.490
Moe-moe-kyun-kyun!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:41.330
Musashi-han?
Moe-moe-kyun-kyun!

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:41.890
Moe-moe-kyun-kyun!

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:43.230
Get yummy! Get yummy!

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:44.460
What's gotten into you?
Get yummy! Get yummy!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:45.700
Get yummy! Get yummy!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.780
Moe-moe-kyun-kyun!

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:53.390
Get yummy! Get yummy!

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.350
Moe-moe-kyun!

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:58.500
I never thought we'd be able to pull in such a big haul on the first day.

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:00.440
It's time for a strategic meeting.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:03.400
How about increasing the table charge 50,000?

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:04.500
Isn't that...

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.620
We could readjust the service fee to 30%.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.060
Don't tell me...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.400
We could also add an automatic renewal.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.140
A ripoff!

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:15.100
Yeah!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.370
I'm Yagyuu Juubei!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.190
No, not you.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:26.140
We're not looking for a maid, but for a Master Samurai.

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:29.050
The one strong enough to have sealed Amakusa Shiro.

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:32.340
Yeah, I'm really strong!

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:36.840
Fine. Then let's have a duel.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.020
What business do you have with Juubei?

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:43.420
How do you know about the government's secrets?

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:46.570
Depending on how you answer, you might not leave so freely.

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.490
Come, Juubei-san.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:52.490
I'm guessing you all know where the Yagyuu Dojo is.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.200
Of course we do.

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:55.820
This is the Yagyuu Dojo.

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.080
What business do you have with us?

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:03.540
Oh, so you're Yagyuu Muneakira?

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.000
We've been searching for you.

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.340
We've come to crush your dojo!

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:13.460
The poster girl's back!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.880
No one's here!

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:21.430
I'm so pissed! They all skipped work and left me behind!

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:23.600
They're gonna pay for this!

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:24.940
There they are!

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:31.240
Changing the location won't change the inevitable outcome!

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:32.480
Fool!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.530
There is no victory without first spilling blood!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:37.780
Yukimura, do you have a plan?

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:42.340
Not in the slightest, but we can't let them ruin the cafe.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:45.080
We don't have any money to pay for repairs.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:48.720
That's enough chit-chat.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:51.670
We've come to crush your dojo. Let's begin!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.190
Crush the dojo? How bold!

00:12:56.190 --> 00:13:01.400
I, the champion of love, Naoe Kanetsugu, will teach you all a lesson!

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:05.500
Hey! Thanks for showing us the way here!

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:06.600
No problem!

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:09.190
What? You brought them here?

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:12.500
You helped the very people who came to crush the dojo? You fool!

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:15.460
How useless can you get?

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.190
You're the real danger.

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:23.450
I see! So the "danger" removed from the house was Kanetsugu!

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:29.840
That's why I'm taking responsibility for it and dealing with them!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.460
Stop, Kanetsugu!

00:13:42.490 --> 00:13:46.310
We revived when we heard you defeated Amakusa,

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.900
but this is all we get?

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:50.110
Don't disappoint us!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.820
Kanetsugu!

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:53.200
Gutsugutsu-san!

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.930
N-No way!

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:58.080
What's wrong, Hanzou?

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.480
The numbers...

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:03.420
Their stats surged to Master Samurai levels in a flash!

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.330
What?

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:06.920
Are you serious, Hanzou-san?

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:07.710
Yes.

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:09.710
Then we've got no choice.

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:12.660
You must all become Master Samurai too!

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:14.740
Very well.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:18.220
Hanzou-san, Matabei-san, rescue Kanetsugu when you see an opening.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:18.880
Roger.

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:20.200
Juubei.

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:22.320
Are you ready?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.610
That's it!

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:51.960
Juubei!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:58.010
No way! Juubei-san's vanished!

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:03.010
I was afraid of this. She really disappeared.

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:04.620
No way!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:06.820
She can't become a Master Samurai?

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:08.390
Oh, come on!

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:11.650
Is this the best the Yagyuu Dojo samurai can do?

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:14.180
You're nothing special.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.480
Call out Yagyuu Juubei already!

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.610
Yagyuu Juubei's not at this dojo!

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:20.960
What?

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:22.900
Then where is she?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.800
W-Well...

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:25.900
On a journey.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:30.940
She's on a yearlong journey to enhance her training.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.480
A year?! Don't mess with me!

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:36.500
You just made that up, didn't you?

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:39.180
And if we did?

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:40.840
Come at us!

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.130
We'll handle you in a flash!

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.930
You're not nearly powerful enough.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.910
What?

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:51.100
If even Master Samurai aren't strong enough,

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:53.400
then just who are you?

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:56.820
I've been in a good mood since reviving, so I'll clue you in on things.

00:15:56.820 --> 00:16:01.150
We're sword wielders who were born to fight! Dark Samurai!

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:04.660
And I'm Miyamoto Musashi!

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:12.760
No way!

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.460
She broke the General's power just like that?!

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:15.720
Onii-chan!

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:18.060
Juubei, don't move!

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:27.260
Now I, Sasaki Kojiro, am up next.
Remember the name.

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:30.130
Leave her to me.

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:33.020
Come! I'll take you on.

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.900
Such a cute samurai.

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:42.530
Is that your best shot?

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:51.750
Impossible! She broke through my defense!

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:55.170
Is this supposed to be a defense? Don't make me laugh!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.100
Yukimura!

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.510
I'll play with you.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.180
I'm Araki Mataemon.

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:11.760
Sounds good to me.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:12.980
Let's do it!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.670
Brute force isn't enough to defeat me!

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:22.260
I'm also faster than you.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:24.800
You!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.570
She blocked my attacks with one hand?

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:31.140
Now it's my turn!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:39.830
No way! These numbers are insane!

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.630
Milady! Run!

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:46.220
I'll take her attack head on!

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:48.050
Great!

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:52.810
Princess Sen!

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.220
Milady!

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.270
No way!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.900
Hozoin Inshun.

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:21.580
What's this?

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.870
What?

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.650
Say your prayers!

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:59.140
Onii-chan! Onii-chan!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.330
Wake up, Onii-chan!

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:03.630
Are you okay, Onii-chan?

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.720
You're not hurt, Muneakira?

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:09.130
Yeah, I think.

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.840
What on Earth happened to me?
What are these marks?

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:13.640
It seals your General powers.

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:18.520
That seal will eventually acclimate to your body

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.140
and completely erase your powers as a General.

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:23.060
You've got one month.

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:26.420
That's as long as we'll wait.

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:28.530
Bring back Yagyuu Juubei before then.

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:33.580
Otherwise, you'll be unable to swing that sword for the rest of your life.

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:34.280
Stop right there!

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:39.580
Do you really think you can get away with doing this to Muneakira?

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.920
Do you want to play some more?

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.650
Play?

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:45.950
Princess Sen.

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:50.880
As painful as it is to admit, we're no match for them in our current state.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.340
Are you okay, Muneakira?

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:00.510
Onii-chan...

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:05.960
Muneakira!

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:07.490
Muneakira-san!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:09.440
Are you okay, Onii-chan?

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.360
Yeah, don't worry.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:12.320
I'm fine.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.820
I just can't hold my sword.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.490
B-But...

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.390
One month...

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:28.070
We need Yagyuu Juubei to return and stand up against their power.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:35.050
The Dark Samurai... Just who on Earth are they?

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:39.640
Welcome back, milady!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:41.060
Hey!

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:43.360
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.100
Didn't we have a month?

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:50.120
Don't be so tense! Can't I come as a customer?

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:54.360
No, you can't! Do you have any idea how much the hospital costs were?!

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.890
You only got what you deserved.

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:01.160
Then I expect you to pay for the food you ate yesterday, too.

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:03.400
Oh, come on.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.830
Hey, fake Juubei!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.060
Bring me that rice thing!

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:09.800
I'm not a fake! I'm the-

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:12.380
Of course! Right away!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.630
I'm expecting that spell again!

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:17.920
Okie-dokie!

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:20.980
That's a Dark Samurai?

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:23.810
We lost to <i>her</i>?

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:25.920
Let's do it!

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:29.700
Moe-moe-kyun-kyun!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:33.100
Get yummy!

00:21:35.650 --> 00:21:36.780
Episode One

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:40.030
The True Shadow Opens

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:14.910
Matabei-san, have you seen the next title?

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:16.400
It's "Kiss, Again"!

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:17.280
So what?

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:21.790
There have been four times so far where "kiss" was in the episode title.

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:25.240
In three of those episodes, a new Master Samurai appeared.

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:30.780
That means there's a very high chance you or I will become Master Samurai next episode!

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:32.460
I wonder which one of us it'll be!

00:23:32.460 --> 00:23:33.920
I'm so excited!

00:23:33.920 --> 00:23:35.810
Next time: Kiss, Again.

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:38.440
I know who's becoming a Master Samurai!

00:23:38.440 --> 00:23:40.030
No spoilers please!
